      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The methodology will involve the targeted genomic editing of the *HBB* locus within hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells (HSPCs) utilizing a ribonucleoprotein (RNP) complex comprising Cas9 endonuclease and a guide RNA (gRNA). Delivery of this complex will be achieved via optimized electroporation protocols to ensure high transfection efficiency. Subsequent analysis will employ next-generation sequencing (NGS) methodologies to rigorously quantify on-target indel frequencies and to perform comprehensive bioinformatic interrogation for potential off-target mutagenesis events.",
      "source": "target",
